 "answer"] [:db/add "caa84d65-7734-5833-b30f-0692f3355cb3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "caa84d65-7734-5833-b30f-0692f3355cb3" :answer-field/choices "ef0d9fcb-a667-5a85-886b-f50fc6acfb74"] [:db/add "caa84d65-7734-5833-b30f-0692f3355cb3" :answer-field/correct "ef0d9fcb-a667-5a85-886b-f50fc6acfb74"] [:db/ensure "caa84d65-7734-5833-b30f-0692f3355cb3" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ea3cd195-fdb7-5c6e-8504-469d2e3e5bab" :question/id #uuid "ea3cd195-fdb7-5c6e-8504-469d2e3e5bab"] [:db/add "ea3cd195-fdb7-5c6e-8504-469d2e3e5bab" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int 1/u\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "ea3cd195-fdb7-5c6e-8504-469d2e3e5bab" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{\\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\ln\\left|\\sin^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right|\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "ea3cd195-fdb7-5c6e-8504-469d2e3e5bab" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ea3cd195-fdb7-5c6e-8504-469d2e3e5bab" :question/answer-fields "caa84d65-7734-5833-b30f-0692f3355cb3"] [:db/ensure "ea3cd195-fdb7-5c6e-8504-469d2e3e5bab" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068918 :knowledge-point/questions "ea3cd195-fdb7-5c6e-8504-469d2e3e5bab"] [:db/add "ce712152-3ba6-54ef-b73d-bbd1f4166638" :answer/id #